- Deploy the application online.
- Add fragrance comparisons and more detailed recommendation explanations.

## ⚠️ Disclaimer

Scent Sense is an experimental recommendation prototype. Results depend on the available catalogue data and recommendation algorithm. Estimated fragrance characteristics may not perfectly reflect individual preferences.

